1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:45,461 --> 00:01:53,941
Twenty-Second Episode
A New King

15
00:02:20,901 --> 00:02:23,893
I would be capable of doing it,
if I really wanted to do it!

16
00:02:23,941 --> 00:02:27,138
Until now I have been
so lacking in initiative and lazy.

17
00:02:27,181 --> 00:02:29,741
Now I have decided
that I have courage!

18
00:02:30,221 --> 00:02:32,610
Doctor Uranaru, today I have decided:

19
00:02:32,661 --> 00:02:35,812
I will proclaim things that
tomorrow everyone will be surprised by!

20
00:02:37,901 --> 00:02:40,654
Doctor, wait anxiously
for tomorrow to arrive.

21
00:02:40,701 --> 00:02:44,774
Your Majesty, would you please tell me,
what you intend to proclaim?

22
00:02:45,061 --> 00:02:47,097
I cannot, it is a secret.

23
00:02:47,141 --> 00:02:49,814
Now, Uranaru, leave me alone.
Go away, quickly! Come on!

24
00:02:49,861 --> 00:02:51,738
Yes, yes, Your Majesty!

25
00:03:14,581 --> 00:03:17,300
I wanted to change
that old law of Silverland

26
00:03:17,341 --> 00:03:19,457
that forbids a woman
from becoming King...

27
00:03:19,501 --> 00:03:21,890
...and ruling the country.
It was about time to put an end...

28
00:03:21,941 --> 00:03:25,092
...to these stupid
discriminations, of course.

29
00:03:31,621 --> 00:03:33,020
There, it's done.

30
00:03:33,061 --> 00:03:36,736
Afterwards, I want to change all
the bad laws into good laws!

31
00:03:38,781 --> 00:03:42,694
But what's happening?!
What are you doing?!

32
00:03:44,421 --> 00:03:46,139
Who are you?

33
00:03:47,221 --> 00:03:49,132
Let go of me!

34
00:04:06,741 --> 00:04:08,811
Prince! Prince!

35
00:04:09,501 --> 00:04:12,573
Prince, this is a good one!
The King is nowhere to be found!

36
00:04:12,621 --> 00:04:14,373
- What?!
- He can't be found!

37
00:04:14,421 --> 00:04:16,810
He hasn't been seen anywhere
since this morning!

38
00:04:16,861 --> 00:04:19,011
How is Mother?
How are the others?

39
00:04:19,061 --> 00:04:21,177
They are desperately searching for the King!

40
00:04:21,501 --> 00:04:25,050
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

41
00:04:28,701 --> 00:04:31,499
- But where is the King?!
- Where is the King?

42
00:04:34,661 --> 00:04:38,017
Search for him again!
On every floor! Quickly!

43
00:04:38,061 --> 00:04:40,814
Go! Your Majesty!

44
00:04:43,741 --> 00:04:45,493
Father, where are you?

45
00:04:45,541 --> 00:04:48,009
- Your Majesty!
- Your Majesty!

46
00:04:48,301 --> 00:04:50,178
Your Majesty!

47
00:04:50,701 --> 00:04:53,773
Prince, we have searched for him
in every corner of the castle,

48
00:04:53,821 --> 00:04:56,130
- But we didn't find him!
- Inspect the moat!

49
00:04:56,181 --> 00:04:58,012
Yes, Prince!

50
00:05:00,301 --> 00:05:03,020
Your Majesty, the King
remained writing something...

51
00:05:03,061 --> 00:05:05,416
...for a long time, alone!

52
00:05:05,461 --> 00:05:07,691
If something bad
were to happen to him..!

53
00:05:07,941 --> 00:05:10,216
I'm going to look for him again, mother!

54
00:05:12,301 --> 00:05:14,815
I imagine you are
very worried!

55
00:05:14,861 --> 00:05:17,898
Anyway, it is very strange that the King
disappeared like this, all of a sudden.

56
00:05:17,941 --> 00:05:20,296
- Isn't that right?
- Don't say useless things!

57
00:05:20,341 --> 00:05:22,332
I'm going to look for
him too, Your Majesty!

58
00:05:25,861 --> 00:05:29,695
Father! Father!

59
00:05:30,101 --> 00:05:32,251
Father, where are you?

60
00:05:32,581 --> 00:05:36,415
Father, where are you? Father!

61
00:05:38,021 --> 00:05:40,012
He's not here...

62
00:05:41,021 --> 00:05:42,898
That armor...

63
00:05:47,021 --> 00:05:48,818
Father!

64
00:05:51,181 --> 00:05:53,251
Father!

65
00:05:54,821 --> 00:05:58,939
Could he be in the tomb of the
ancestors? But that's impossible...!

66
00:06:01,301 --> 00:06:04,498
Father! Father!

67
00:06:08,021 --> 00:06:12,333
Father! Father!

68
00:06:17,180 --> 00:06:19,092
I heard a noise!

69
00:06:19,900 --> 00:06:23,098
Father!
It must have been an illusion...

70
00:06:23,140 --> 00:06:25,018
- What?!
- Prince!

71
00:06:25,060 --> 00:06:27,529
There is a man who claims
to have seen the King...

72
00:06:27,580 --> 00:06:30,049
...early this morning!
- What? Where?

73
00:06:31,020 --> 00:06:34,934
- In the northern part of the valley.
- Alright, I'm going to check!

74
00:06:37,820 --> 00:06:40,016
Opal, go to the northern valley!

75
00:07:14,660 --> 00:07:16,538
Father!

76
00:07:18,420 --> 00:07:21,333
Opal! What is wrong with you?

77
00:07:22,820 --> 00:07:24,095
What?!

78
00:07:25,860 --> 00:07:28,011
That shoe looks like my father's!

79
00:07:28,060 --> 00:07:31,212
Opal, hold the end
of this rope in your mouth! I'm going down!

80
00:07:52,460 --> 00:07:54,452
What's wrong, Opal?

81
00:07:56,580 --> 00:07:58,299
Opal!

82
00:08:23,860 --> 00:08:26,739
This is dad's shoe!
Just as I thought...!

83
00:08:33,500 --> 00:08:35,173
Darling!

84
00:08:43,180 --> 00:08:45,536
I am truly very sorry.

85
00:08:47,181 --> 00:08:49,012
Mother!

86
00:08:56,341 --> 00:08:59,617
Father! Why did you die?!

87
00:09:31,821 --> 00:09:34,255
Grand Duke, since the King is dead,

88
00:09:34,301 --> 00:09:36,656
the Prince will ascend the throne
in a week.

89
00:09:37,621 --> 00:09:40,340
The new King! King Sapphire!

90
00:09:40,541 --> 00:09:43,613
If our plan goes well
until that moment...

91
00:09:43,661 --> 00:09:46,016
It will be very interesting
to wait and see!

92
00:09:47,741 --> 00:09:49,891
- What are you laughing at, idiot?!
- But I...

93
00:10:18,541 --> 00:10:21,374
- Sapphire, it's me.
- Please, come in.

94
00:10:23,461 --> 00:10:25,577
Mother, what do you think?

95
00:10:26,021 --> 00:10:28,489
You are beautiful, Sapphire

96
00:10:29,821 --> 00:10:32,016
Did you think I was crying?

97
00:10:32,061 --> 00:10:34,211
Yes. I came to comfort you

98
00:10:34,381 --> 00:10:38,260
From now on, I won't cry anymore.
Instead, I was getting dressed.

99
00:10:38,581 --> 00:10:40,492
And why is that, dear?

100
00:10:41,021 --> 00:10:44,013
This is the last time
that I can dress like this.

101
00:10:44,061 --> 00:10:46,017
- What?!
- If I become King,

102
00:10:46,061 --> 00:10:48,416
I'll never be able to wear
a dress like this again.

103
00:10:48,461 --> 00:10:52,136
- Then wear it as if it were
the last. - All right, mother.

104
00:10:54,581 --> 00:10:56,253
Nurse, are you there?

105
00:10:56,301 --> 00:10:59,657
Oh, yes!
I was helping her get dressed!

106
00:11:00,061 --> 00:11:02,336
Nurse, please don't cry!

107
00:11:02,381 --> 00:11:06,135
- Now give me a smile!
- How can I not cry?!

108
00:11:06,181 --> 00:11:09,173
Sapphire, this won't be
the last time you dress like this.

109
00:11:09,221 --> 00:11:11,212
- What?!
- When you become King,

110
00:11:11,261 --> 00:11:13,900
you can modify the law
and make a new one,

111
00:11:13,941 --> 00:11:17,013
so that everyone, even women,
can become King.

112
00:11:17,461 --> 00:11:20,692
I understand! I'll be able to be King
even though I'm a girl!

113
00:11:20,741 --> 00:11:22,333
I will do it!

114
00:13:39,461 --> 00:13:42,692
The coronation ceremony
will take place tomorrow.

115
00:13:42,741 --> 00:13:45,016
The preparations are almost complete

116
00:13:45,061 --> 00:13:48,337
A large delegation has arrived
from all parts of the world.

117
00:13:53,021 --> 00:13:56,138
I think Prince Sapphire
has settled down...

118
00:13:56,181 --> 00:13:58,376
...and is waiting for dawn.

119
00:14:01,181 --> 00:14:03,217
God, please give me strength!

120
00:14:03,261 --> 00:14:05,695
I'm afraid of becoming King! I fear it!

121
00:14:05,741 --> 00:14:09,780
Soon the sun will rise.
God, please protect me!

122
00:14:20,181 --> 00:14:23,139
Pharmacist, haven't you
made that medicine yet?

123
00:14:23,861 --> 00:14:26,614
It's almost finished. In
three hours it will be ready.

124
00:14:26,661 --> 00:14:30,131
Hurry up or we won't make it in
time for the coronation ceremony.

125
00:14:30,181 --> 00:14:33,810
We'll make it in time, we'll make it
in time for the coronation ceremony!

126
00:14:34,181 --> 00:14:36,490
- But does it really work?
- All it takes is for someone...

127
00:14:36,541 --> 00:14:39,738
...to take just a little of it
to say everything they think.

128
00:14:39,781 --> 00:14:42,659
If we don't make it in time,
you will die! Understood?

129
00:14:43,421 --> 00:14:46,140
I will wait here
until you have finished.

130
00:14:46,901 --> 00:14:48,732
Come on, hurry up!

131
00:14:51,021 --> 00:14:53,216
How violent you are!

132
00:14:54,021 --> 00:14:56,012
I've gotten very thirsty.

133
00:14:56,101 --> 00:14:58,820
- Drink a little from that flask.
- Yes.

134
00:15:04,021 --> 00:15:05,818
But what did you make me drink?

135
00:15:06,901 --> 00:15:10,337
Calm down,
there's nothing to worry about!

136
00:15:13,261 --> 00:15:15,934
But I'm swelling up!
I'm going to burst!

137
00:15:16,301 --> 00:15:19,577
No, don't fear!
Now I will give you a good remedy right away.

138
00:15:21,021 --> 00:15:24,809
- Yes, but hurry!
- Here, drink!

139
00:15:32,221 --> 00:15:37,420
- You cursed wretch!
- Now stay calm and rest!

140
00:15:38,221 --> 00:15:41,452
Let me work in peace
until I am finished!

141
00:16:09,021 --> 00:16:11,012
Let the coronation ceremony begin..

142
00:16:11,061 --> 00:16:13,017
..of Prince Sapphire!

143
00:16:20,701 --> 00:16:22,578
Everything will be fine..

144
00:16:26,661 --> 00:16:29,459
Now the grand coronation ceremony begins!

145
00:16:29,501 --> 00:16:31,492
Here, many representatives are gathered.

146
00:16:31,541 --> 00:16:33,736
...who have come from all parts of the world!

147
00:16:33,781 --> 00:16:35,658
They are waiting for the Prince!

148
00:16:35,701 --> 00:16:37,817
When Prince Sapphire sits on the throne,

149
00:16:37,861 --> 00:16:40,216
he will be the new King of Silverland!

150
00:16:40,261 --> 00:16:42,411
Here comes Grand Duke Duralumin!

151
00:16:46,621 --> 00:16:48,737
Dad, I'm hungry!

152
00:16:49,021 --> 00:16:51,819
Shut up!
Soon there will be the banquet!

153
00:16:54,821 --> 00:16:58,780
Idiot..! And stop it!
Here, I'll give you this sweet!

154
00:17:00,741 --> 00:17:03,130
Here comes the Queen!

155
00:17:06,301 --> 00:17:08,895
Sapphire, the ceremony will go well.

156
00:17:09,421 --> 00:17:13,016
- But where is Nylon?
- He hasn't arrived yet, sir

157
00:17:13,061 --> 00:17:14,813
But what is he doing?!

158
00:17:15,901 --> 00:17:19,450
Our Archbishop
is arriving!

159
00:17:33,221 --> 00:17:36,657
And here comes
Prince Sapphire!

160
00:18:03,541 --> 00:18:06,214
Let the coronation ceremony
begin!

161
00:18:11,221 --> 00:18:15,214
One, two, three... My God!
There are a hundred diamonds!

162
00:18:15,261 --> 00:18:18,936
Oh, no! No! No! I say that there
are at least two hundred of them!

163
00:19:06,301 --> 00:19:08,257
- Bravo!
- Shut up!

164
00:19:08,901 --> 00:19:11,734
- Grand Duke, Nylon is back!
- Really?

165
00:19:12,141 --> 00:19:15,292
Tell him to put that
medicine in the Queen's wine!

166
00:19:21,501 --> 00:19:25,016
The Grand Duke has ordered to
put the medicine in the Queen's wine!

167
00:19:25,061 --> 00:19:26,813
Come on, quick, give it to me!

168
00:19:26,861 --> 00:19:29,295
- What?! No! I won't give it to you!
- Why not?

169
00:19:29,341 --> 00:19:31,616
I brought it and I
want to put it in myself.

170
00:19:31,661 --> 00:19:33,777
...in the Queen's wine!
Damn it!

171
00:19:34,021 --> 00:19:37,457
No, you must rest!
I told you I'll do it!

172
00:19:37,501 --> 00:19:39,890
And I told you that
I will do it! Go away!

173
00:19:39,941 --> 00:19:43,092
- You must rest! Understood?
- I don't care!

174
00:19:43,221 --> 00:19:46,213
And now, let the toast begin!

175
00:19:46,261 --> 00:19:49,537
Everyone, pour wine
into your glasses!

176
00:19:49,941 --> 00:19:54,014
Grand Duke Duralumin,
please, start the toast!

177
00:19:57,421 --> 00:19:59,889
Just a moment! Is
this the Queen's glass?

178
00:19:59,941 --> 00:20:01,738
- Yes, sir.
- Ah, excellent!

179
00:20:10,261 --> 00:20:11,819
We did it!

180
00:20:37,701 --> 00:20:42,297
And now let us toast to the
health of King Sapphire of Silverland!

181
00:20:42,341 --> 00:20:44,252
- Cheers!
- Hooray!

182
00:20:45,941 --> 00:20:47,659
Cheers!

183
00:20:47,701 --> 00:20:50,090
Long live our King!

184
00:20:50,821 --> 00:20:53,210
Grand Duke Duralumin
looks strange!

185
00:20:53,261 --> 00:20:55,058
I wonder why...

186
00:20:59,221 --> 00:21:00,813
Mother!

187
00:21:02,501 --> 00:21:05,413
Someone escort the
Queen to her room!

188
00:21:07,501 --> 00:21:09,731
It's nothing, dear! It's nothing!

189
00:21:09,781 --> 00:21:13,137
It's just that I didn't know it
was so bitter to hide the truth!

190
00:21:13,181 --> 00:21:15,741
- Mother!
- Now everyone pay attention...

191
00:21:15,781 --> 00:21:18,136
... and listen to me, because
I will tell you everything!

192
00:21:19,581 --> 00:21:21,617
What is happening, Queen?

193
00:21:23,341 --> 00:21:27,812
Sapphire is my daughter!
Sapphire is a girl!

194
00:21:31,421 --> 00:21:33,616
Yes, Sapphire is a girl!

195
00:21:33,661 --> 00:21:36,653
To make her King,
we deceived you...

196
00:21:36,701 --> 00:21:39,693
...and we publicly
passed her off as a boy!

197
00:21:46,061 --> 00:21:49,417
You all heard! You
are all witnesses!

198
00:21:49,461 --> 00:21:51,452
This mother and her
daughter have lied...

199
00:21:51,501 --> 00:21:54,254
...and have deceived
the people for 13 years!

200
00:21:54,741 --> 00:21:57,858
They are cowards who
have deceived good people!

201
00:21:57,901 --> 00:22:01,610
- Oh, no! Did I say something?
- Mother, it's too late!

202
00:22:02,021 --> 00:22:03,613
What?!

203
00:22:03,661 --> 00:22:06,129
It's true: it's too late now!

204
00:22:06,341 --> 00:22:09,651
You have confessed
everything! Soldiers, arrest them!

205
00:22:09,701 --> 00:22:12,579
And also arrest their
three accomplices!

206
00:22:18,421 --> 00:22:21,254
As punishment, I order
them to be locked up

207
00:22:21,301 --> 00:22:23,861
...in the coffin
tower until they die!

208
00:22:23,901 --> 00:22:26,654
- Is there anyone who opposes?
- The coffin tower?!

209
00:22:26,701 --> 00:22:28,498
Until we die?!

210
00:22:28,541 --> 00:22:31,419
And their three accomplices,
as punishment for helping them,

211
00:22:31,461 --> 00:22:34,294
- will be slaves!
- Slaves?! - Slaves?

212
00:22:34,621 --> 00:22:37,897
One more thing:
I have decided that my son Plastic

213
00:22:37,941 --> 00:22:40,819
...will become the new King!
- What? Plastic the new King?!

214
00:22:40,861 --> 00:22:42,852
But it's not possible! He's an idiot!

215
00:22:44,581 --> 00:22:47,891
Plastic will be the King!
Is there anyone who wants to oppose?

216
00:22:53,861 --> 00:22:57,012
And now take away
those vile traitors!

217
00:22:57,221 --> 00:23:00,531
Princess Sapphire and Queen,
it is unpleasant, I know,

218
00:23:01,461 --> 00:23:04,214
but please get into
the prisoners' carriage!

219
00:23:08,741 --> 00:23:10,493
Let's go, Mother.

220
00:23:13,181 --> 00:23:15,411
Sapphire, please, forgive me!

221
00:23:15,581 --> 00:23:18,459
You have been trapped
by Duralumin, Mother.

222
00:23:18,501 --> 00:23:20,810
I think you drank
some drugged wine.

223
00:23:21,781 --> 00:23:23,817
I will never see you again, I think.

224
00:23:24,821 --> 00:23:27,016
Then farewell! Farewell!

225
00:24:12,501 --> 00:24:14,298
This is the Coffin Tower.

226
00:24:14,341 --> 00:24:17,253
Princess Sapphire, Queen,
I am sorry,

227
00:24:17,301 --> 00:24:19,815
but once
you are locked in there,

228
00:24:19,861 --> 00:24:22,329
You will never be able to get out of it again.
Prepare yourselves.

229
00:24:48,741 --> 00:24:52,361
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

230
00:24:52,362 --> 00:24:55,722
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

231
00:24:55,723 --> 00:24:59,493
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

232
00:24:59,494 --> 00:25:02,655
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

233
00:25:02,656 --> 00:25:06,469
♪ Sen'nen man'nen hyakuman-nen ♪
A thousand years, ten thousand years, a million years,

234
00:25:06,470 --> 00:25:09,766
♪ Ribbon de tsunagou ichioku-nen ♪
Let’s connect with ribbons for a billion years!

235
00:25:09,767 --> 00:25:13,772
♪ Akuma ga kute mo arashi ga kute mo ♪
Even if devils come, even if storms arrive,

236
00:25:13,773 --> 00:25:17,211
♪ tsunaida kokoro wa hanarenai ♪
Our bonded hearts will never part.

237
00:25:17,212 --> 00:25:20,832
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

238
00:25:20,833 --> 00:25:24,193
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

239
00:25:24,194 --> 00:25:27,964
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

